{"id":"cartridges-anatomy","rev":1,"lang":"hu","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"A töltény felépítése","summary":"Hüvely, csappantyú, lőpor, fojtás, sörét és peremezés: mi van egy koronglövő töltényben, hogyan hat minden rész a lövésre, és milyen töltényeket tiltanak a Sporting™ és a Compak® Sporting szabályai.","body":[{"k":"gear-cartridges-p1","t":"p","html":"Egy <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/hu/glossary/cartridge/\"><span lang=\"en\">cartridge</span> (töltény)</a> mindent tartalmaz egy lövéshez: a <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/hu/glossary/hull/\"><span lang=\"en\">hull</span> (hüvelyt)</a> a fém fenékkel, a <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/hu/glossary/primer/\"><span lang=\"en\">primer</span> (csappantyút)</a>, a <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/hu/glossary/powder/\"><span lang=\"en\">powder</span> (lőport)</a>, a <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/hu/glossary/wad/\"><span lang=\"en\">wad</span> (fojtást)</a> és a sörétet. A lövészek „shell”-nek is hívják. Az <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/hu/glossary/empties/\"><span lang=\"en\">empty cases</span> (üres hüvelyek)</a> a kilőtt hüvelyeket jelenti.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null,"anchor":"gear-cartridges"},{"k":"dg-cartridge-cutaway","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\">Egy lőszer hosszanti metszetben</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"40 70 520 250\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\" focusable=\"false\"><rect class=\"dg-c1\" x=\"96\" y=\"96\" width=\"440\" height=\"138\" rx=\"3\"/><rect class=\"dg-cut\" x=\"104\" y=\"104\" width=\"424\" height=\"122\"/>\n<path class=\"dg-c2\" d=\"M58 86h20v6h80v146h-80v6h-20z\"/><rect class=\"dg-c3\" x=\"58\" y=\"148\" width=\"26\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-c4\" x=\"158\" y=\"104\" width=\"54\" height=\"122\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-c5\" x=\"212\" y=\"104\" width=\"16\" height=\"122\"/><path class=\"dg-c5l\" d=\"M228 112 l11 106 l11 -106 l11 106 l11 -106M272 106h194M272 224h194M272 106v118\"/>\n<circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"282\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"293.8\" cy=\"116\" r=\